      "description": "Acción de formulario o navegación con respuesta al pulso.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-primary\">Buscar prácticas<svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 17 17 7M7 7h10v10\"/></svg></button>",
      "css": ".ds-primary{font-family:var(--font-text,\"Urbanist Variable\",sans-serif);display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;min-height:46px;padding:11px 18px;border:1px solid transparent;border-radius:9px;background:var(--primary,#204c3c);color:var(--primary-foreground,#fff);font-size:14px;font-weight:650;cursor:pointer;transition:transform .18s ease,background .18s ease}.ds-primary:hover{transform:translateY(-1px);filter:brightness(.93)}.ds-primary:active{transform:translateY(1px)}.ds-primary:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--ring,#387655);outline-offset:4px}.ds-primary:disabled{opacity:.6;cursor:not-allowed}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-primary{transition:none}}"
