      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-chips\" aria-label=\"Tipo\"><a href=\"#todos\" aria-current=\"page\">Todas</a><a href=\"#aprendizaje\">Contrato de aprendizaje</a></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-chips{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px}.ds-chips a{font-family:var(--font-text,\"Urbanist Variable\",sans-serif);display:flex;align-items:center;min-height:40px;padding:8px 16px;border:1px solid var(--border,#dce3da);border-radius:30px;background:var(--card,#fff);color:var(--foreground,#192c25);font-size:12px;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none}.ds-chips a[aria-current]{background:var(--foreground,#192c25);border-color:var(--foreground,#192c25);color:var(--background,#f8faf7)}.ds-chips a:hover{background:var(--muted,#edf0ea);color:var(--foreground,#192c25)}.ds-chips a:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--ring,#387655);outline-offset:4px}@media(max-width:767px){.ds-chips a{min-height:44px}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Fila de oportunidad",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "opportunity-row",
      "description": "Organización, título, remuneración y trazabilidad comparables.",
      "html": "<article class=\"ds-row\"><span class=\"ds-initials\" aria-hidden=\"true\">OV</span><div class=\"ds-row-body\"><p>Organización de ejemplo · convocatoria ficticia</p><h2><a href=\"#convocatoria\">Práctica en tu área <svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 17 17 7M7 7h10v10\"/></svg></a></h2><p>Medellín · Híbrida · Práctica profesional</p><strong>Apoyo por confirmar</strong><p class=\"ds-source\">Fuente oficial · Verificación pendiente</p></div></article>",
      "css": ".ds-row{font-family:var(--font-text,\"Urbanist Variable\",sans-serif);display:flex;gap:18px;padding:24px;border:1px solid var(--border,#dce3da);border-radius:14px;background:var(--card,#fff);color:var(--foreground,#192c25);transition:transform .2s ease,border-color .2s ease}.ds-row:hover{transform:translateY(-2px);border-color:var(--primary,#204c3c)}.ds-initials{display:grid;place-items:center;flex-shrink:0;width:46px;height:46px;border-radius:12px;background:#eef0e9;color:#42533e;font-weight:600}.ds-row-body{flex:1;min-width:0}.ds-row p{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted-foreground,#5b6860);margin:0 0 10px}.ds-row h2{font-family:var(--font-display,\"Bricolage Grotesque Variable\",sans-serif);font-size:21px;line-height:1.25;letter-spacing:-.025em;margin:0 0 12px}.ds-row h2 a{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:15px;color:inherit;text-decoration:none}.ds-row a:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--ring,#387655);outline-offset:4px}.ds-row strong{font-size:15px;font-weight:650}.ds-row .ds-source{border-top:1px solid var(--border,#dce3da);padding-top:10px;margin-top:15px;font-size:12px}@media(max-width:767px){.ds-row{padding:18px 16px;gap:11px}.ds-initials{width:35px;height:35px}.ds-row h2{font-size:20px}.ds-row p{font-size:12px}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-row{transition:none}}"
