      "html": "<section class=\"ds-start\"><h2>Empieza por lo que estudias.</h2><p>Encuentra oportunidades para tu formación.</p><a href=\"/practicas?nivel=tecnologo\">Soy tecnólogo/a <svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 17 17 7M7 7h10v10\"/></svg></a><a href=\"/practicas?nivel=universitario\">Soy universitario/a <svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 17 17 7M7 7h10v10\"/></svg></a></section>",
      "css": ".ds-start{font-family:var(--font-text,\"Urbanist Variable\",sans-serif);padding:32px;border-radius:24px;background:#204c3c;color:#f2f7e9}.ds-start h2{font-family:var(--font-display,\"Bricolage Grotesque Variable\",sans-serif);font-size:30px;line-height:1.12;letter-spacing:-.035em;font-weight:500;margin:0}.ds-start p{font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;color:#c4d4c7;margin:14px 0 30px}.ds-start a{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;min-height:55px;border-top:1px solid #52745e;color:#f2f7e9;font-size:13px;text-decoration:none}.ds-start a:hover{color:var(--lime,#d5f477)}.ds-start a svg{transition:transform .2s}.ds-start a:hover svg{transform:translateX(4px)}.ds-start a:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--lime,#d5f477);outline-offset:4px}@media(max-width:767px){.ds-start{padding:26px;border-radius:20px}.ds-start h2{font-size:26px}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-start a svg{transition:none}}"
